# Context-exclusion list for AI agents (Phase 1 principle #9, docs/PHASE1-2_TARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md).
# Mirrors .gitignore's build/vendor exclusions, plus content assets that never need to be read to
# perform a code/content change - only their existence or filename matters.

# Build output / vendor
node_modules/
_site/
.cache/

# Content assets - large, binary or near-binary, never need reading to make a change
public/downloads/**/*.pdf
tools/worksheet_gen/samples/**/*.pdf
*.jpg
*.png
*.ttf

# Lockfiles - large, machine-generated, never hand-edited
package-lock.json

# Claude Code local/machine state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Untracked personal folders that happen to live in this working directory but are NOT part of the
# repo (confirmed via `git ls-files` in the Phase 0 audit - see docs/INVENTORY.md Section 0)
ACT Mr. Mohamed Abdallah/
AP calculus AB/
Blue stick/
EST Exams/
Worksheets/
